{
  "opencollection": "1.0.0",
  "info": {
    "name": "Remote Address Details Timesheets API",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "request": {
    "auth": {
      "type": "oauth2",
      "flow": "client_credentials",
      "accessTokenUrl": "/auth/oauth2/token",
      "credentials": {
        "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
        "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
      }
    }
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Timesheets",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Show timesheet",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/timesheets/:id",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "ec23ebda-4b7a-4dbd-9d79-bd1eec3f83c9",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Timesheet ID"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Shows a timesheet by its ID.\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage timeoffs (`time_and_attendance`) | View timesheets (`timesheet:read`) | Manage timesheets (`timesheet:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create a contractor timesheet",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/contractors/employments/:employment_id/timesheets",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "employment_id",
                "value": "c0a167b8-459d-4e96-9766-7a04c160892e",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Contractor employment ID"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates a timesheet on behalf of a contractor employment.\n\nThe submitted hours are immediately available to the contractor in the Remote UI for\nself-serve invoice creation (Invoices → Create invoice → \"Use Time Tracking\").\n\nThis endpoint is restricted to contractor employments. Calls against EOR or Global Payroll\nemployments are rejected with `422`.\n\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage timeoffs (`time_and_attendance`) | - | "
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List timesheets for the authenticated employee",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/employee/timesheets",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "1",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Starts fetching records after the given page"
              },
              {
                "name": "page_size",
                "value": "20",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Number of items per page"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "flow": "client_credentials",
              "accessTokenUrl": "/auth/oauth2/token",
              "credentials": {
                "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns a paginated list of timesheets for the authenticated employee.\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage timeoffs (`time_and_attendance`) | View timesheets (`timesheet:read`) | Manage timesheets (`timesheet:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Approve timesheet",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/timesheets/:timesheet_id/approve",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "timesheet_id",
                "value": "ec23ebda-4b7a-4dbd-9d79-bd1eec3f83c9",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Timesheet ID"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Approves the given timesheet.\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage timeoffs (`time_and_attendance`) | - | Manage timesheets (`timesheet:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List timesheets",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/timesheets",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "status",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filter timesheets by their status"
              },
              {
                "name": "order",
                "value": "asc",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Sort order"
              },
              {
                "name": "sort_by",
                "value": "submitted_at",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Field to sort by"
              },
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "1",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Starts fetching records after the given page"
              },
              {
                "name": "page_size",
                "value": "20",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Number of items per page"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Lists all timesheets.\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage timeoffs (`time_and_attendance`) | View timesheets (`timesheet:read`) | Manage timesheets (`timesheet:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Send back a timesheet for review or modification",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/timesheets/:timesheet_id/send-back",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "timesheet_id",
                "value": "ec23ebda-4b7a-4dbd-9d79-bd1eec3f83c9",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Timesheet ID"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Sends the given timesheet back to the employee for review or modification.\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage timeoffs (`time_and_attendance`) | - | Manage timesheets (`timesheet:write`) |\n"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
}